  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inter-Faith Dialogue on Sustainability of Peace and the enhancement of national unity.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a 5-day residential inter-religious dialogue conference aimed at enhancing peace and national unity ahead of the forth coming national elections (2010) and referendum (2011), contributing towards the sustainability of the Comprehensive Peace Agreement (CPA). The conference is organized by the Directorate of Religious Affairs in the Ministry for Gender, Social Welfare and Religious Affairs in consultation with Soudan Council of Churches (SCC), Southern Sudan Islamic Association (SSIA), Southern Sudan Peace Commission (SSPC) and Office of Presidential Advisor on Religious Affairs (GoSS). CAFOD Juba office will manage the grant allocated for the conference in consultation with the Directorate of Religious Affairs, to avoid government bureaucracies on channelling of funds and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
